Photato — Native Swift fork of PhotoCraft

This independent macOS port derives from https://github.com/storytold/photocraft.
Changes: a native Swift editing engine and AppKit/SwiftUI application, native Apple imaging and
optional Apple AI integration, plus new tests, documentation and packaging. Full upstream and
Photoshop feature parity is still in progress. Distributed under MIT OR Apache-2.0.

The original upstream notice is retained below. Its bundled font/icon/dictionary inventory
refers to the Rust distribution; these assets are not included in the native Swift application.
The Swift application uses macOS system fonts and SF Symbols. Its actual attribution inventory
is ATTRIBUTION.md. This fork is not endorsed by the ArtCraft Team or Adobe.

The native Hue/Saturation overlap approximation adapts MIT-licensed psd-tools material.
Copyright (c) 2019 Kota Yamaguchi. See LICENSE-psd-tools and ATTRIBUTION.md.

